---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') 
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1) 
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="earlify-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-top-badges">
      <span class="badge badge-cyan">🩺 Evaluación Clínica VIA+</span>
      <span class="badge badge-emerald">🏠 Continuidad en Casa Valeria+</span>
      <span class="badge badge-purple">🇪🇸 Español & 🇬🇧 Inglés</span>
      <span class="badge badge-amber">🔒 100% Offline</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Official Earlify Health Logo Card -->
    <div class="earlify-logo-wrapper">
      <div class="earlify-logo-card">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/earlify-logo.png?v=3`} 
          alt="Logo Oficial de Earlify Health S.L." 
          class="earlify-logo-img" 
          width="240"
          height="240"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Evaluar mejor. <span class="gradient-text">Dar continuidad antes.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      Earlify Health desarrolla productos digitales para mejorar el recorrido asistencial en neurodesarrollo.
    </p>

    <!-- Core Challenge Box -->
    <div class="core-challenge-box glass-card">
      <div class="box-icon">⚡</div>
      <div class="box-content">
        <p class="box-text">
          La evaluación clínica y el acompañamiento de las familias suelen funcionar como momentos separados. El profesional recoge información y toma decisiones en consulta; después, muchas familias vuelven a casa sin una estructura clara para continuar los objetivos, actividades y seguimiento en el día a día.
        </p>
        <span class="box-highlight">Earlify conecta ambos momentos.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#dos-productos" class="btn-primary">
        <span>Dos Productos. Un Recorrido Continuo</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#de-la-consulta-a-la-casa" class="btn-secondary">
        <span>De la Consulta a la Vida Cotidiana</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .earlify-hero {
    padding-top: 130px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-top-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .earlify-logo-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 1.75rem auto;
  }

  .earlify-logo-card {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.25rem 2.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45), 0 0 25px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .earlify-logo-card:hover {
    transform: scale(1.04) translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), 0 0 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  }

  .earlify-logo-img {
    height: 200px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem auto;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .core-challenge-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.85rem;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
    text-align: left;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .box-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .box-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .box-highlight {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }
    .core-challenge-box {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
